<!--
  The works the readings are attested in. An entry in Haftarah.xml or
  SpecialReadings.xml names them in its `sources` attribute, by the `n` here.

  kind: chumash, siddur, halachah, study, website, or reconstruction.
  A reconstruction is not a work of its own: it is a reading established by
  combining others, which it names in `combines`.
-->
<ReadingSources>
  <source n="michlol" kind="website" name="hamichlol"
